                "text": "CVE-2026-8458 high vulnerability for curl package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in libcurl. A logical error in the connection pooling mechanism may cause libcurl to reuse an authenticated connection for an unintended service. This could allow an application to wrongfully reuse an existing connection to the same server that was authenticated for a different service, potentially leading to unauthorized access or information disclosure."
