              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in SQLite. An attacker can cause a Denial of Service (DoS) by supplying specially crafted SQL queries or an untrusted database view containing deeply chained COLLATE operators. This flaw bypasses expression depth limitations, triggering unbounded recursion and stack exhaustion that crashes the application process."
