                "text": "CVE-2026-119378 medium vulnerability for sqlite-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in SQLite. A use-after-free vulnerability in the R-Tree extension allows an attacker to cause a Denial of Service (DoS) by convincing a user or service to process a specially crafted database. By manipulating internal shadow tables used by the extension, the application improperly accesses previously freed memory during index operations, causing the process to crash."
