              "name": "RpmMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-119371 medium vulnerability for sqlite-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in SQLite. This vulnerability allows an attacker to cause a Denial of Service (DoS) through stack exhaustion. By providing a specially crafted SQL query or an untrusted database file with deeply nested Common Table Expressions (CTEs), an attacker can bypass expression nesting limits. This triggers unbounded recursive function calls during query expansion, causing the application to crash."
              },
