                "text": "CVE-2026-119372 medium vulnerability for sqlite-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in SQLite. A use-after-free vulnerability exists in its full-text search extension due to improper handling of cached memory pointers during query processing. An attacker can exploit this issue by executing a specially crafted full-text search query, causing the application to access previously freed memory and crash, resulting in a Denial of Service (DoS)."
              },
